    "facts": [
      "The retry timeout is a fixed 4000000 cycles at 64000000 Hz, or 62.5 ms.",
      "P9_FAULT_INJECTION exposes only an eight-bit ACK-candidate drop counter.",
      "The counter is decremented when a local cumulative-ACK snapshot is consumed, not once per serialized ACK frame.",
      "A later cumulative ACK can therefore acknowledge the outstanding window without any DATA retransmission even when the counter starts at 255.",
      "Existing protocol_fault_flags bit 3 forces the first three DATA attempts to sequence initial_sequence-1 while retaining canonical payload metadata.",
      "The selective-repeat RX classifies a same-session sequence behind its base by receive_distance>=0x8000 and increments duplicate_count."
